OL,3,GNEWSATeacher sexually abused pupils at
OL,4,Amultiple schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former PE teacher has been found to
OL,7,Fhave sexually abused three pupils,
OL,8,Fafter admitting offences against two
OL,9,Fgirls and being found guilty of
OL,10,Foffences against a boy.
OL,12,FBronwen James, 30, of Chippenham,
OL,13,FWiltshire, previously admitted nine
OL,14,Fsexual offences against two teenage
OL,15,Fgirls - one a pupil at Bitterne Park
OL,16,FSchool in Southampton and the other at
OL,17,FHardenhuish School in Chippenham.
OL,19,FShe was convicted earlier at Winchester
OL,20,FCrown Court of three counts of sexual
OL,21,Factivity with a 16-year-old boy who
OL,22,Falso attended Bitterne Park School.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
